{"id":"640660","name":"鸡蛋三明治","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/640660/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面包片","amount":"4片"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2枚"}],"sub":[{"name":"奶酪","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋打散摊成蛋饼。","img":"images/640660/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切四瓣。","img":"images/640660/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"趁热把奶酪加进去。","img":"images/640660/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"生菜切丝。","img":"images/640660/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面包片放进微波炉微40秒。取一片在中间加沙拉酱。","img":"images/640660/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将鸡蛋片稍作调整放在面包片上。","img":"images/640660/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再加一点沙拉酱。","img":"images/640660/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"铺生菜丝。再在上面加一点沙拉酱。","img":"images/640660/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖另外一片面包。","img":"images/640660/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入模具。","img":"images/640660/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖盖子用力压。","img":"images/640660/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最好啦！把另外一个也做好。","img":"images/640660/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"简单早餐做好啦！配上点水果。","img":"images/640660/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"一起吃早餐吧！","img":"images/640660/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}